  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police HC (AWO/TPO) PE &amp; MT Date 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-07-30T18:20:12+05:30\">July 30, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">6:20 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC Delhi Police)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> PHYSICAL ENDURANCE AND MEASUREMENT TEST (PE&amp;MT)</strong>\u00a0on its\u00a0<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Head Constable (AWO/TPO)\u00a0Examination 2025.</strong>\u00a0The\u00a0<strong>Exam</strong>\u00a0<span data-teams=\"true\">was conducted on<strong> 15 \u2013 22 January 2026</strong></span><strong>,</strong>\u00a0The\u00a0<strong>SSC</strong>\u00a0application process started on\u00a0<strong data-end=\"339\" data-start=\"319\">24 September 2025</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u00a0<strong data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"401\">15 October 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>Additional Result\u00a0</strong>using their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"302\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n      